<title>USA: Amtran Q3 load load factor down to 71 pct.</title>
<headline>Amtran Q3 load load factor down to 71 pct.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		  1995</p>
<p> Load factor - percent     71.4		75.8</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles   2,687	     2,633</p>
<p> Available seat miles	3,764	     3,474</p>
<p>					    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent     69.9		72.4</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles   7,480	     6,995</p>
<p> Available seat miles	10,706	    9,662</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in 000,000s)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-to-date is nine months.</p>
<p>Full company name is Amtran Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
